When activated, your spells and abilities deal 20% more magic damage while costing 20% more mana to cast. This effect lasts 15 sec.

@ext:Does not stack with other similar effects.:ext@

@ext:This ability can be used while in Cat, Bear, Moonkin or Tree of Life Shapeshifts.:ext@

Increases the target's chance to critically hit with spells by 3%. 

When the target critically hits the caster's chance to critically hit with spells is increased by 3% for 10 sec. 

@ext:Cannot be cast on self.:ext@

Unleashes the energy of a Seal spell to judge an enemy for 20 sec, granting auto attacks and auto shots made against the judged enemy a chance of healing the attacker for 2% of their base health. 

@ext:Refer to individual Seals for additional Judgement effect.:ext@

@ext:Only one Judgement per Paladin can be active at any one time.:ext@

Reduces all damage taken by 50% for 12 sec.

Cannot be used within 30 sec of using Avenging Wrath.

@ext:This ability is usable while shapeshifted.:ext@

Teleports the caster 20 yards forward.

This ability can be used while casting, but not channeling, and does not trigger a global cooldown.

@ext:This uses Blink modifiers.:ext@

